{"id":"610496","name":"鸡蛋火腿奶香饼","author":"优子家的味道","authorId":"9910251","desc":"","cover":"images/610496/cover.jpg","ingredients":{"main":[{"name":"鸡蛋","amount":"3个"},{"name":"火腿肠","amount":"1个"},{"name":"牛奶","amount":"适量"},{"name":"面粉","amount":"半勺"}],"sub":[{"name":"葱","amount":"适量"},{"name":"黑芝麻","amount":"适量"}]},"steps":[{"step":1,"desc":"葱花、火腿肠切丁、鸡蛋、牛奶、面粉。","img":"images/610496/step_1.jpg"},{"step":2,"desc":"三个鸡蛋打入碗中。","img":"images/610496/step_2.jpg"},{"step":3,"desc":"放入半勺面粉。","img":"images/610496/step_3.jpg"},{"step":4,"desc":"依次放入葱花、火腿肠、盐、味精、十三香。","img":"images/610496/step_4.jpg"},{"step":5,"desc":"倒入适量牛奶。","img":"images/610496/step_5.jpg"},{"step":6,"desc":"搅拌均匀。","img":"images/610496/step_6.jpg"},{"step":7,"desc":"至糊状即可。","img":"images/610496/step_7.jpg"},{"step":8,"desc":"电饼铛预热刷油。","img":"images/610496/step_8.jpg"},{"step":9,"desc":"倒入一勺面糊并迅速摊匀。","img":"images/610496/step_9.jpg"},{"step":10,"desc":"撒上黑芝麻。","img":"images/610496/step_10.jpg"},{"step":11,"desc":"盖盖煎一分钟。","img":"images/610496/step_11.jpg"},{"step":12,"desc":"一分钟后翻面。","img":"images/610496/step_12.jpg"},{"step":13,"desc":"盖盖再煎三十秒即可出锅。","img":"images/610496/step_13.jpg"},{"step":14,"desc":"美味漂亮，营养丰富，老少皆宜！","img":"images/610496/step_14.jpg"}],"tips":"尽可能的把饼摊薄一点，以免影响口感。 \n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t来自 美食天下  的作品\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t使用的厨具：电饼铛\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t所属分类：","attrs":{}}